<h2>Creating Skills (Skill Engineering)</h2>
<p>Once you have used them well, the thought "I want to make one myself" comes naturally. <strong>Making skills is called skill engineering</strong>, and a <strong>skill-making skill (skill-creator)</strong> that helps with it comes built in.</p>

<h3>skill-creator &mdash; the meta skill</h3>
